WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.705
The brief starts with the result requested and the

00:00:02.797 --> 00:00:07.284
existing constraint Put the supplier conflict beside the diary

00:00:07.323 --> 00:00:09.639
facts so the reader can see why a decision

00:00:09.678 --> 00:00:10.297
is needed

00:00:11.127 --> 00:00:16.205
Compare feasible options recommend one and explain why Name

00:00:16.297 --> 00:00:21.179
the decision required Then list unresolved approval and acceptance

00:00:21.218 --> 00:00:24.311
conditions rather than presenting them as settled facts

00:00:25.652 --> 00:00:28.402
Write your own first brief before opening the later

00:00:28.468 --> 00:00:32.732
case update You will compare it with subsequent confirmed

00:00:32.784 --> 00:00:36.587
information without pretending that you knew those later facts

00:00:36.639 --> 00:00:37.455
at the start
